(6918624, 1043351, 10785, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast on multiple levels. I am sure you have a reason for it but I would like to see the flowers closer to center of each frame.</td>', 'Like the contrast on multiple levels. I am sure you have a reason for it but I would like to see the flowers closer to center of each frame.', '2012-12-01 21:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
