(6918692, 1043258, 10785, '<td valign="top">I am seeing some banding in the sky here, whereas the water shows a nice, smooth gradient. The line works well for composition and the color really pops!<br/> <br/>ETA: The banding looked much worse on the ipad. I can still see it a little on my PC. Bump for you!</td>', 'I am seeing some banding in the sky here, whereas the water shows a nice, smooth gradient. The line works well for composition and the color really pops! ETA: The banding looked much worse on the ipad. I can still see it a little on my PC. Bump for you!', '2012-12-01 23:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6918720, 1043300, 86218, '<td valign="top">Lovely use of light coming in from top and soft focusing really helps this image. I would have removed the pink line at bottomand maybe have opened up the chin and lips just a tad. Nicely done</td>', 'Lovely use of light coming in from top and soft focusing really helps this image. I would have removed the pink line at bottomand maybe have opened up the chin and lips just a tad. Nicely done', '2012-12-01 23:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
