(6918727, 1043327, 86218, '<td valign="top">Actually works very well and there is enough difined lines to make this blur work and stir up feelings/emotions. Im not keen on the red lights as a small nit and would have prefreed to have kept this purely natural without human presence. Very artistic. Great effeort and liek this very much</td>', 'Actually works very well and there is enough difined lines to make this blur work and stir up feelings/emotions. Im not keen on the red lights as a small nit and would have prefreed to have kept this purely natural without human presence. Very artistic. Great effeort and liek this very much', '2012-12-01 23:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6918728, 1043362, 108580, '<td valign="top">Crisp and close, good glow and focus in/on the eye, excellent exposure on the ram. BG a bit busy and mottled sunlight bright and distracting from the animal.</td>', 'Crisp and close, good glow and focus in/on the eye, excellent exposure on the ram. BG a bit busy and mottled sunlight bright and distracting from the animal.', '2012-12-01 23:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
