(6920701, 1042998, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images. <br/> <br/>Positives: Great how the individual elements hang together - the notion of ''gallery'' on the right adding textual weight to the visual elements. The colours are really complementary too.<br/> <br/>Critical stuff: I do kind of with you were lower and straighter-on with you POV - that would have accentuated the canvas illusion even more.<br/> <br/>Overall: What a great eye. Effective.</td>', 'I''m going through the entries, stopping at those images I feel have had the benefit of an unconventional eye and dwelling a little longer to try to see and appreciate what you saw. This is one of those images.  Positives: Great how the individual elements hang together - the notion of ''gallery'' on the right adding textual weight to the visual elements. The colours are really complementary too. Critical stuff: I do kind of with you were lower and straighter-on with you POV - that would have accentuated the canvas illusion even more. Overall: What a great eye. Effective.', '2012-12-03 08:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920703, 1043362, 114225, '<td valign="top">I nice portrait of what looks to be a thoughtful creature.</td>', 'I nice portrait of what looks to be a thoughtful creature.', '2012-12-03 08:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920704, 1042698, 114225, '<td valign="top">Getting a little bit of vertigo from the angle with fisheye. Creates an interesting effect.</td>', 'Getting a little bit of vertigo from the angle with fisheye. Creates an interesting effect.', '2012-12-03 08:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
