(6920793, 1043249, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>Lovely light and equally lovely scenery. The path to the bridge and the rolling hills with the colorful trees beyond just begs for me to step onto the Road. I would not mind not keeping mind where my feet trend because there is infinite beauty to be swept off too:-) The only critique I have for this is that it is a shame the ''letterbox'' composition will only allow for it to be appreciated at a smaller size.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  Lovely light and equally lovely scenery. The path to the bridge and the rolling hills with the colorful trees beyond just begs for me to step onto the Road. I would not mind not keeping mind where my feet trend because there is infinite beauty to be swept off too:-) The only critique I have for this is that it is a shame the ''letterbox'' composition will only allow for it to be appreciated at a smaller size.', '2012-12-03 09:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920803, 1043227, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment. <br/> <br/>I have seen these location photographed before but this is the first I''ve seen it in B&amp;W. Very beautiful and the B&amp;W tones are perfect. Love all the details I can see from the slats on the boardwalk, to the leaves, to the individual houses themselves. The water is calm and serene giving an strong impression that living here promises peaceful solitude. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment.  I have seen these location photographed before but this is the first I''ve seen it in B&W. Very beautiful and the B&W tones are perfect. Love all the details I can see from the slats on the boardwalk, to the leaves, to the individual houses themselves. The water is calm and serene giving an strong impression that living here promises peaceful solitude. Very nicely done.', '2012-12-03 09:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920806, 1043321, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Ha! I love it! The early bird has come to shop! I take it he was the first at the door for Black Friday sales:-) Love how the gull is standing there peering into the store - I''m sure he would love all the edible goodies pictured in the posters on the windows. Great find and great capture.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Ha! I love it! The early bird has come to shop! I take it he was the first at the door for Black Friday sales:-) Love how the gull is standing there peering into the store - I''m sure he would love all the edible goodies pictured in the posters on the windows. Great find and great capture.', '2012-12-03 09:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920811, 1043360, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow, nice vibrant colors with those rich golden yellows! Love the textures and details I can see in the petals and the center portion of the flower. Beautifully done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wow, nice vibrant colors with those rich golden yellows! Love the textures and details I can see in the petals and the center portion of the flower. Beautifully done.', '2012-12-03 09:35:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920818, 1043393, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>This is a fabulous close-up of this wooly sheep. Love that I can see all the details from the fine hair on it''s mouth area to the whorls and curls of the hair complete with bits of hay &amp; grass. The only thing that would be an <u>extra bonus </u>is if the eye was seen peeking out from behind all the hair.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. This is a fabulous close-up of this wooly sheep. Love that I can see all the details from the fine hair on it''s mouth area to the whorls and curls of the hair complete with bits of hay & grass. The only thing that would be an extra bonus is if the eye was seen peeking out from behind all the hair.', '2012-12-03 09:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920824, 1043375, 12611, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. from the puffy jacket to the thin little legs, to the cold sun of winter.</td>', 'Excellent shot. from the puffy jacket to the thin little legs, to the cold sun of winter.', '2012-12-03 09:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920826, 1043153, 12611, '<td valign="top">A dreamy nature shot. deserves a long look.</td>', 'A dreamy nature shot. deserves a long look.', '2012-12-03 09:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920828, 1043207, 128654, '<td valign="top">Makes me think!  Good job!</td>', 'Makes me think!  Good job!', '2012-12-03 09:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920829, 1041857, 12611, '<td valign="top">Best title I have seen in a while. Hold on to those leaves little buddy!</td>', 'Best title I have seen in a while. Hold on to those leaves little buddy!', '2012-12-03 09:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920830, 1043123, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>There is just something captivating about this composition. The feathers arranged like cast off angel wings is what truly makes this picture interesting. It makes me wonder why and how the angel cast off the wings. Was it done willingly or forcefully? The morning dew on the feathers is a nice touch for it adds another textural detail and conjures imagery of the morning (heh, perhaps it is tears for the lost angel and signifies mourning). The only critique I have is that I wish it was in more focus and detail on the left feather and the back of the right feather as that details are a bit soft. Perhaps greater DOF and some burning to get shadows and details back would help.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. There is just something captivating about this composition. The feathers arranged like cast off angel wings is what truly makes this picture interesting. It makes me wonder why and how the angel cast off the wings. Was it done willingly or forcefully? The morning dew on the feathers is a nice touch for it adds another textural detail and conjures imagery of the morning (heh, perhaps it is tears for the lost angel and signifies mourning). The only critique I have is that I wish it was in more focus and detail on the left feather and the back of the right feather as that details are a bit soft. Perhaps greater DOF and some burning to get shadows and details back would help.', '2012-12-03 09:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920833, 1043272, 128654, '<td valign="top">I would prefer not as busy foreground...maybe captured the image after the waves have broken.  But I like the colours and very good composition!  Well done.</td>', 'I would prefer not as busy foreground...maybe captured the image after the waves have broken.  But I like the colours and very good composition!  Well done.', '2012-12-03 09:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920835, 1043122, 12611, '<td valign="top">I stared a while at this portrait, in the context of the title, and my eyes moved about, from the scarf to textures to the bokeh, to the skin tones to the eyes, and I wished <i>I was the one</i> to have taken such a shot.</td>', 'I stared a while at this portrait, in the context of the title, and my eyes moved about, from the scarf to textures to the bokeh, to the skin tones to the eyes, and I wished I was the one to have taken such a shot.', '2012-12-03 09:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920838, 1043316, 12611, '<td valign="top">The angles of the building really add drama to terrific skies and super color tones.</td>', 'The angles of the building really add drama to terrific skies and super color tones.', '2012-12-03 09:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920840, 1041116, 12611, '<td valign="top">I love the landscape, cold, clean and contrast is spot on.(8) <br/> <br/>(a side note is that I generally like borders, but my eyes perceive the white line on top as brighter and thicker than the one on the bottom.)</td>', 'I love the landscape, cold, clean and contrast is spot on.(8)  (a side note is that I generally like borders, but my eyes perceive the white line on top as brighter and thicker than the one on the bottom.)', '2012-12-03 09:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920841, 1042844, 12611, '<td valign="top">I like the grayed off light here, the pedestrians behinds, the shapes and tones in fabric and in life.</td>', 'I like the grayed off light here, the pedestrians behinds, the shapes and tones in fabric and in life.', '2012-12-03 09:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920842, 1043376, 12611, '<td valign="top">nice repeating lines and shapes,</td>', 'nice repeating lines and shapes,', '2012-12-03 10:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920844, 1043085, 12611, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, I would hope this is Ireland or New Zealand. At least in my own mind it is, and the sunrise is pulling the road up to meet me.</td>', 'Beautiful, I would hope this is Ireland or New Zealand. At least in my own mind it is, and the sunrise is pulling the road up to meet me.', '2012-12-03 10:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920849, 1041878, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is a nice wildlife shot.  I think a tighter crop on the head and snake would make it a lot better.</td>', 'This is a nice wildlife shot.  I think a tighter crop on the head and snake would make it a lot better.', '2012-12-03 10:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920850, 1043262, 114225, '<td valign="top">The pig coming out is cute.</td>', 'The pig coming out is cute.', '2012-12-03 10:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920851, 1043371, 114225, '<td valign="top">The shadows that would normally be distracting actually seem to work fine here.</td>', 'The shadows that would normally be distracting actually seem to work fine here.', '2012-12-03 10:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920852, 1040252, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of this one, but I feel a landscape crop would have worked better.  As it is there is too much dead space at the top and bottom.</td>', 'I like the idea of this one, but I feel a landscape crop would have worked better.  As it is there is too much dead space at the top and bottom.', '2012-12-03 10:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920853, 1043094, 114225, '<td valign="top">Having exactly three people in the shot is a nice number that allows the eyes to flow smoothly. Although I may have chosen to crop the bottom as it doesn''t add anything.</td>', 'Having exactly three people in the shot is a nice number that allows the eyes to flow smoothly. Although I may have chosen to crop the bottom as it doesn''t add anything.', '2012-12-03 10:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920855, 1043219, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting that the one star on the far left is so bright.<br/> <br/>I find myself wanting to see more of the rocks and less of the brush.</td>', 'Interesting that the one star on the far left is so bright. I find myself wanting to see more of the rocks and less of the brush.', '2012-12-03 10:10:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920856, 1041933, 114225, '<td valign="top">A powerful creature.<br/>I''m not seeing great details in this, which are what make bird portraits special in many cases.</td>', 'A powerful creature.I''m not seeing great details in this, which are what make bird portraits special in many cases.', '2012-12-03 10:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920857, 1042755, 39880, '<td valign="top">I like the mood of this shot, but the blob on the left is kind of distracting.</td>', 'I like the mood of this shot, but the blob on the left is kind of distracting.', '2012-12-03 10:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920858, 1043312, 114225, '<td valign="top">Alert as she approaches the new area. I like the tension you can feel.</td>', 'Alert as she approaches the new area. I like the tension you can feel.', '2012-12-03 10:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920859, 1043207, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I love how the lamp works so well with the color processing you chose.</td>', 'Nicely done. I love how the lamp works so well with the color processing you chose.', '2012-12-03 10:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920860, 1043227, 39880, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones in this.  Just an all around nice shot.</td>', 'I really like the tones in this.  Just an all around nice shot.', '2012-12-03 10:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920862, 1043190, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouettes that add some mystery to this image. the colors aren''t over saturated which is good.</td>', 'Nice silhouettes that add some mystery to this image. the colors aren''t over saturated which is good.', '2012-12-03 10:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920863, 1043216, 39880, '<td valign="top">Why do I feel like I am in "The Birds" movie.  This has a nice look and feel to it.</td>', 'Why do I feel like I am in "The Birds" movie.  This has a nice look and feel to it.', '2012-12-03 10:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
