(6920875, 1043354, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting, my eye immediately goes to the ball, then searches the rest of the photo to find the focal point.</td>', 'Interesting, my eye immediately goes to the ball, then searches the rest of the photo to find the focal point.', '2012-12-03 10:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
