(6920899, 1043336, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I love the B&amp;W tones in the composition.  Great details and textures can be seen in the leaves and plant life. Love the composition as that it appears as if I am peering into the foliage to gaze upon those two dried leaves.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I love the B&W tones in the composition.  Great details and textures can be seen in the leaves and plant life. Love the composition as that it appears as if I am peering into the foliage to gaze upon those two dried leaves.', '2012-12-03 10:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920903, 1043313, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>This is a superb still life. Lighting is fabulous. The rough texture of the wood and the details of the old &amp; rusted tools are illuminated perfectly. The tools may be old but this picture brings them back into the light of day such that they are no longer forgotten. Well done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. This is a superb still life. Lighting is fabulous. The rough texture of the wood and the details of the old & rusted tools are illuminated perfectly. The tools may be old but this picture brings them back into the light of day such that they are no longer forgotten. Well done.', '2012-12-03 10:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920908, 1043057, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice in black and white.</td>', 'Very nice in black and white.', '2012-12-03 10:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6920910, 1043081, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very pretty bird with good color pop. Knock out some of that background noise, and I think the photo will look even nicer.</td>', 'Very pretty bird with good color pop. Knock out some of that background noise, and I think the photo will look even nicer.', '2012-12-03 10:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
