(6921501, 1043389, 147314, '<td valign="top">Great landscape and the central road lines are OK here. The whole image is a bit dark I think, some variety in darker and lighter areas could lighten up the image.</td>', 'Great landscape and the central road lines are OK here. The whole image is a bit dark I think, some variety in darker and lighter areas could lighten up the image.', '2012-12-03 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
