(6921644, 1043390, 25787, '<td valign="top">He''s so cute!!</td>', 'He''s so cute!!', '2012-12-03 19:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921668, 1042717, 112739, '<td valign="top">Beautiful HDR work.  I am however curious about the tilted horizon. Also, there seems to be some lens or sensor spots in the sky that can be taken care of. I also see some grain in the shadows that can be taken care of with some finer adjustments or a local NR. The overall exposure is spot on. Detail is exquisite, DOF is deep and perfect, colors are brilliant. I think the image is fantastic, but I am still unsure of the horizon. 8</td>', 'Beautiful HDR work.  I am however curious about the tilted horizon. Also, there seems to be some lens or sensor spots in the sky that can be taken care of. I also see some grain in the shadows that can be taken care of with some finer adjustments or a local NR. The overall exposure is spot on. Detail is exquisite, DOF is deep and perfect, colors are brilliant. I think the image is fantastic, but I am still unsure of the horizon. 8', '2012-12-03 20:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921672, 1043228, 112739, '<td valign="top">I think I know what you saw and what you were trying to capture here. I see highlights in grass often and still, it remains illusive. The abstract feel is awesome though.  Life beginning again.</td>', 'I think I know what you saw and what you were trying to capture here. I see highlights in grass often and still, it remains illusive. The abstract feel is awesome though.  Life beginning again.', '2012-12-03 20:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921674, 1043129, 112739, '<td valign="top">Glorious work here. An inviting scene that makes me want to buy a plane ticket.</td>', 'Glorious work here. An inviting scene that makes me want to buy a plane ticket.', '2012-12-03 20:16:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921675, 1041485, 112739, '<td valign="top">Lovely intimate image.</td>', 'Lovely intimate image.', '2012-12-03 20:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921676, 1043243, 112739, '<td valign="top">A subtle moment captured. Well done.</td>', 'A subtle moment captured. Well done.', '2012-12-03 20:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921678, 1043386, 112739, '<td valign="top">I hope to learn more about this story.</td>', 'I hope to learn more about this story.', '2012-12-03 20:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921682, 1041799, 112739, '<td valign="top">Tough choice on where to place the horizon, but I think I see why you chose this comp. The clouds are too tempting to leave out of either sky or reflection.  But, if you can make a decision either way, the image may have come away with a whole different feel.</td>', 'Tough choice on where to place the horizon, but I think I see why you chose this comp. The clouds are too tempting to leave out of either sky or reflection.  But, if you can make a decision either way, the image may have come away with a whole different feel.', '2012-12-03 20:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921685, 1040252, 112739, '<td valign="top">Not sure why you chose a portrait orientation for this. The sky is empty and takes too much weight from the balance. There are not enough interesting elements to make up the deficit. The image brings on a cold and lonely feeling though.</td>', 'Not sure why you chose a portrait orientation for this. The sky is empty and takes too much weight from the balance. There are not enough interesting elements to make up the deficit. The image brings on a cold and lonely feeling though.', '2012-12-03 20:28:03.000000', NULL, 1);
