(6921863, 1043216, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Introducing grain is a tricky thing - it can either add to an image or be an unnecessary addition. Here it acts as a great compliment. It adds to the sense of grit and edgy feel that is just further accented by the very dynamic B&amp;W tones. The birds on the wire take flight and there seems a sense of foreboding in the air. The sky is gloomy which adds to that sense of ''something is about to happen''. It makes me wonder what message will these birds deliver.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Introducing grain is a tricky thing - it can either add to an image or be an unnecessary addition. Here it acts as a great compliment. It adds to the sense of grit and edgy feel that is just further accented by the very dynamic B&W tones. The birds on the wire take flight and there seems a sense of foreboding in the air. The sky is gloomy which adds to that sense of ''something is about to happen''. It makes me wonder what message will these birds deliver.', '2012-12-03 22:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921866, 1043273, 112739, '<td valign="top">Wow, you have presented a whole different scene on a well known city, and done a fantastic job.</td>', 'Wow, you have presented a whole different scene on a well known city, and done a fantastic job.', '2012-12-03 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921872, 1043313, 112739, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Lots of details.</td>', 'Very, very nice. Lots of details.', '2012-12-03 23:01:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921877, 1043376, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Love the vanishing point to the horizon that the columns create. Light and detail is amazing. Great composition that highlights the beauty of this architectural structure.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Love the vanishing point to the horizon that the columns create. Light and detail is amazing. Great composition that highlights the beauty of this architectural structure.', '2012-12-03 23:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921880, 1042952, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Wow, the vibrant reds zip and take me down the road at warp speed. It leads my eye down to the city below. Love the details of the lights that shine and sparkle in the night. Very well done night shot - it is not easy to achieve that level of balance in detail when you have bright lights, long exposure, and night sky. Great job.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Wow, the vibrant reds zip and take me down the road at warp speed. It leads my eye down to the city below. Love the details of the lights that shine and sparkle in the night. Very well done night shot - it is not easy to achieve that level of balance in detail when you have bright lights, long exposure, and night sky. Great job.', '2012-12-03 23:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921882, 1043305, 43463, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment and upon review bumping up a notch.<br/> <br/>O.K. now that is a rare and special capture:-) The horse seems to be hamming it up and smiling for the camera! Say cheese...er, I mean hay:-) Great capture of a photographer doing his trade. Lighting and composition of the main subjects are well done. The only critique I have is something odd may have happened with the processing as that there is an odd distortion grainy artifacts that happens in the trees in the back.</td>', 'Coming back to comment and upon review bumping up a notch. O.K. now that is a rare and special capture:-) The horse seems to be hamming it up and smiling for the camera! Say cheese...er, I mean hay:-) Great capture of a photographer doing his trade. Lighting and composition of the main subjects are well done. The only critique I have is something odd may have happened with the processing as that there is an odd distortion grainy artifacts that happens in the trees in the back.', '2012-12-03 23:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921883, 1041878, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Fabulous colors and great details. But what makes this shot stellar is the being there to capture the moment that this stork/crane ensnares the snake for his lunch. Fabulous capture of wildlife.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Fabulous colors and great details. But what makes this shot stellar is the being there to capture the moment that this stork/crane ensnares the snake for his lunch. Fabulous capture of wildlife.', '2012-12-03 23:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921900, 1043334, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>The colors, details, and the flames are very spectacular. But the biggest drawback on this image is that the reflection of the several different colors of the chips and the reflections make the image way too busy on the eye. I think a black non-reflective would have improved the visual appeal so that we are not left seeing double. There are alot of bold colors in these composition so to have too many can tip it into sensory overload. I count five different colors on the chips...perhaps it would have been better to have only four or even three.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. The colors, details, and the flames are very spectacular. But the biggest drawback on this image is that the reflection of the several different colors of the chips and the reflections make the image way too busy on the eye. I think a black non-reflective would have improved the visual appeal so that we are not left seeing double. There are alot of bold colors in these composition so to have too many can tip it into sensory overload. I count five different colors on the chips...perhaps it would have been better to have only four or even three.', '2012-12-03 23:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6921903, 1043331, 43463, '<td valign="top">It is the rare instances that some pictures leave me in the lurch as to what I should score it. This is one of them. It is the OH, my - WHat the heck am I seeing?!?!?! shot!!!! You definitely have the shock value, the humor, and the guts to submit a shot like this:-) LOL, I don''t know what else to say except that I hope other people are laughing along with you for the humor of the shot.</td>', 'It is the rare instances that some pictures leave me in the lurch as to what I should score it. This is one of them. It is the OH, my - WHat the heck am I seeing?!?!?! shot!!!! You definitely have the shock value, the humor, and the guts to submit a shot like this:-) LOL, I don''t know what else to say except that I hope other people are laughing along with you for the humor of the shot.', '2012-12-03 23:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
