(6922697, 1042878, 112739, '<td valign="top">Well "seen" and captured "scene". Top notch work. The light is great. I like to use luminosity masks to help tone light and dark areas like this image has. Tony Kuyper<a href="//goodlight.us/writing/luminositymasks/luminositymasks-1.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tony Kuyper</a> has a website with instructions. They work really well for situations like this. They work better than just dodging and burning. Hope I did not step out of line with posting the link.</td>', 'Well "seen" and captured "scene". Top notch work. The light is great. I like to use luminosity masks to help tone light and dark areas like this image has. Tony KuyperTony Kuyper has a website with instructions. They work really well for situations like this. They work better than just dodging and burning. Hope I did not step out of line with posting the link.', '2012-12-04 16:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
