(6923818, 1042977, 147314, '<td valign="top">Recently shoy my first fire works and now I know it''s not that simple. Well done!</td>', 'Recently shoy my first fire works and now I know it''s not that simple. Well done!', '2012-12-05 12:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923821, 1043066, 147314, '<td valign="top">Wow, would also be a great submission for Proportion. Light seems hard, maybe a bit misty? But nice image, showing the nihility of mankind against nature.</td>', 'Wow, would also be a great submission for Proportion. Light seems hard, maybe a bit misty? But nice image, showing the nihility of mankind against nature.', '2012-12-05 12:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923824, 1042457, 39880, '<td valign="top">This is really nice and I like it.  I just think if you got rid of the birds (they look like dust specks) and processed in B&amp;W it would be even better.</td>', 'This is really nice and I like it.  I just think if you got rid of the birds (they look like dust specks) and processed in B&W it would be even better.', '2012-12-05 12:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923827, 1043380, 147314, '<td valign="top">Difficult to comment this image: I like the colours in the sky and the lines of the waves leading to the hotels; but I miss something, it''s just not exciting (e.g. a bit of action on the beach).</td>', 'Difficult to comment this image: I like the colours in the sky and the lines of the waves leading to the hotels; but I miss something, it''s just not exciting (e.g. a bit of action on the beach).', '2012-12-05 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923839, 1043264, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice doggies and I do like the way they are blended in in those shadows. Good title as well!</td>', 'Nice doggies and I do like the way they are blended in in those shadows. Good title as well!', '2012-12-05 12:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923851, 1043206, 147314, '<td valign="top">I like the idea of putting something on the foreground, but unfortunately it is not in focus and therefore distracting to me. I think a lower camera point, that piece of wood in focus and the beachline on one third of the image would make a cracking image.</td>', 'I like the idea of putting something on the foreground, but unfortunately it is not in focus and therefore distracting to me. I think a lower camera point, that piece of wood in focus and the beachline on one third of the image would make a cracking image.', '2012-12-05 12:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923858, 1043094, 147314, '<td valign="top">Nice image with lots of contrast in it. I also like the angle of the camera, adds some nice effect.</td>', 'Nice image with lots of contrast in it. I also like the angle of the camera, adds some nice effect.', '2012-12-05 12:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923877, 1043217, 147314, '<td valign="top">Despite the leading line of the track, I find the foreground emphatically present (hope that''s correct English). To me that beautiful sky is the interesting part and it only has a small part of the image.  I like the colours overall and the distortion of the hoizon is great as well.</td>', 'Despite the leading line of the track, I find the foreground emphatically present (hope that''s correct English). To me that beautiful sky is the interesting part and it only has a small part of the image.  I like the colours overall and the distortion of the hoizon is great as well.', '2012-12-05 12:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6923882, 1043279, 131284, '<td valign="top">I''d have perhaps liked a little more sharpening on the eyes, which to me somehow look less sharp than the rest of the face, but otherwise very nice capture and processing.</td>', 'I''d have perhaps liked a little more sharpening on the eyes, which to me somehow look less sharp than the rest of the face, but otherwise very nice capture and processing.', '2012-12-05 12:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
