(6925361, 1043204, 19825, '<td valign="top">And what a cutie she is -- a radiant smile, a twinkle in her eyes, and a wonderfully expectant look. You''ve captured a magical moment. I think my one concern is regarding the color/tone. Her lips look a little blue to me. Consider warming them up and maybe the skin tone just a tad.</td>', 'And what a cutie she is -- a radiant smile, a twinkle in her eyes, and a wonderfully expectant look. You''ve captured a magical moment. I think my one concern is regarding the color/tone. Her lips look a little blue to me. Consider warming them up and maybe the skin tone just a tad.', '2012-12-06 21:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6925362, 1043313, 19825, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones.</td>', 'Very nice tones.', '2012-12-06 21:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
