(6926530, 1043393, 100831, '<td valign="top">gotta love it... the curls are awesome but the pink nose and big ears... oh my.</td>', 'gotta love it... the curls are awesome but the pink nose and big ears... oh my.', '2012-12-07 20:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
