(6926579, 1043084, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured.</td>', 'Beautifully captured.', '2012-12-07 21:58:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926580, 1042355, 103229, '<td valign="top">this is such a great capture! i just wish there was something to keep my eye in the photo... perhaps a frame or vignette</td>', 'this is such a great capture! i just wish there was something to keep my eye in the photo... perhaps a frame or vignette', '2012-12-07 21:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926581, 1041353, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aw, cute pose :-) I might have toned down the lighting a bit.  A baby being kissed seems like it should be a softer, gently lit cene.</td>', 'Aw, cute pose :-) I might have toned down the lighting a bit.  A baby being kissed seems like it should be a softer, gently lit cene.', '2012-12-07 22:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926583, 1043163, 65234, '<td valign="top">Beautiful butterfly.  I might try a shallower DOF so he stands out better, and try to even out the contrast a bit so I could see more detail on him.</td>', 'Beautiful butterfly.  I might try a shallower DOF so he stands out better, and try to even out the contrast a bit so I could see more detail on him.', '2012-12-07 22:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926588, 1043216, 54645, '<td valign="top">Energetic composition and tones highlighting the mundane. Very engaging despite the heavy vignette and sharpening. You pushed most of my buttons. Well done. <br/> <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Energetic composition and tones highlighting the mundane. Very engaging despite the heavy vignette and sharpening. You pushed most of my buttons. Well done.   ', '2012-12-07 22:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926589, 1042268, 54645, '<td valign="top">A laugh and cringe. Nice catch.</td>', 'A laugh and cringe. Nice catch.', '2012-12-07 22:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926591, 1043265, 103229, '<td valign="top">i have been wanting to do a similar shoot for a while! but i wish i could either see less or more of her face, or perhaps more turn in her body towards the water</td>', 'i have been wanting to do a similar shoot for a while! but i wish i could either see less or more of her face, or perhaps more turn in her body towards the water', '2012-12-07 22:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926592, 1042755, 54645, '<td valign="top">Processed blur and DOF. Been there. Pleasing tone and scene.</td>', 'Processed blur and DOF. Been there. Pleasing tone and scene.', '2012-12-07 22:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926593, 1043230, 54645, '<td valign="top">Irresistible shadow.</td>', 'Irresistible shadow.', '2012-12-07 22:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926594, 1043164, 54645, '<td valign="top">I can only wonder who is following in the car wondering if they screwed up for the last time. The distracting elements of the trash bin and car give it a more human feel. Many would crop it out, including me. Well done. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I can only wonder who is following in the car wondering if they screwed up for the last time. The distracting elements of the trash bin and car give it a more human feel. Many would crop it out, including me. Well done.  ', '2012-12-07 22:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926596, 1043276, 54645, '<td valign="top">There is a strong connection between these two, completely apart from the wildly busy and engaging scene around them. I see disgust and shame coming from both of them. Great conflict all around. Well done. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'There is a strong connection between these two, completely apart from the wildly busy and engaging scene around them. I see disgust and shame coming from both of them. Great conflict all around. Well done.  ', '2012-12-07 22:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6926598, 1043364, 54645, '<td valign="top">Classic. Masterful composition in my opinion. Very few will not relate to the broken concrete and fallen leaf, missing the roots searching for space and life. <br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=963227" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/50000-54999/54645/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_963227.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Classic. Masterful composition in my opinion. Very few will not relate to the broken concrete and fallen leaf, missing the roots searching for space and life.  ', '2012-12-07 22:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
