(6927063, 1043375, 67152, '<td valign="top">I remember our yearly trip to the city to see the Marshall Fields windows.  It was a magical day, with a stop to look at the window displays, then dinner at The Berghoff, and then a show (usually A Christmas Carol or The Nutcracker).  Great memories!  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'I remember our yearly trip to the city to see the Marshall Fields windows.  It was a magical day, with a stop to look at the window displays, then dinner at The Berghoff, and then a show (usually A Christmas Carol or The Nutcracker).  Great memories!  Thanks for sharing.', '2012-12-08 08:51:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6927064, 1043390, 114285, '<td valign="top">I thought this was really cute, nice to see your dog in focus every now and then, lol!</td>', 'I thought this was really cute, nice to see your dog in focus every now and then, lol!', '2012-12-08 08:52:05.000000', NULL, 0),
