(6927168, 1042196, 63218, '<td valign="top">Came back to see if you put any notes on this--you did! I enjoy motion blur &amp; will give this technique a try as soon as I can. There is a feeling of stillness in the subject but motion in the surrounding light that keeps me looking. Definitely, a keeper. 10.</td>', 'Came back to see if you put any notes on this--you did! I enjoy motion blur & will give this technique a try as soon as I can. There is a feeling of stillness in the subject but motion in the surrounding light that keeps me looking. Definitely, a keeper. 10.', '2012-12-08 10:24:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(6927180, 1043227, 138630, '<td valign="top">Fascinating place.  The perspective, detail, lines and tones are excellent.  Congratulations on the blue ribbon.</td>', 'Fascinating place.  The perspective, detail, lines and tones are excellent.  Congratulations on the blue ribbon.', '2012-12-08 10:30:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(6927183, 1043066, 138630, '<td valign="top">Wonderful depth and lovely light with the veiled misty look to the valleys and the sun just catching the balloon.  Congratulations on the ribbon, Steven.</td>', 'Wonderful depth and lovely light with the veiled misty look to the valleys and the sun just catching the balloon.  Congratulations on the ribbon, Steven.', '2012-12-08 10:32:10.000000', NULL, 0);
