(6928807, 1043267, 86218, '<td valign="top">Congrats Harvey with a great image and finish in the FS. Yes - underrated for sure. You just keep getting better at these kind of shots.</td>', 'Congrats Harvey with a great image and finish in the FS. Yes - underrated for sure. You just keep getting better at these kind of shots.', '2012-12-10 04:56:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6928808, 1043236, 86218, '<td valign="top">Unusual entry from you Mita but really a grand shot in B&amp;W. Knowing you Im sure you have reason for the way this image is presented here especially with regards to the F/g. Just love that sky with the soft cotton clouds contrasted with the harsh surrounds this tree is growing in. I suppose the O.o.f f/g enhances this harsh setting but I think the bokeh is also distracting and maybe thats what pulled it down other than noticing soem comments about the Lack of contrast - not so much a bother with me</td>', 'Unusual entry from you Mita but really a grand shot in B&W. Knowing you Im sure you have reason for the way this image is presented here especially with regards to the F/g. Just love that sky with the soft cotton clouds contrasted with the harsh surrounds this tree is growing in. I suppose the O.o.f f/g enhances this harsh setting but I think the bokeh is also distracting and maybe thats what pulled it down other than noticing soem comments about the Lack of contrast - not so much a bother with me', '2012-12-10 05:01:56.000000', NULL, 0),
