(6929360, 1042628, 47316, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by havneet:</b></div><hr/><i> A great silhouette. Love birds with the beautiful Eiffel Tower in the background makes for a great romantic pose. But whats the white spot on the tip? I would have preferred the whole of tower in the pic </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That would be a result of the fog light shining through the fog.</td>', 'Originally posted by havneet: A great silhouette. Love birds with the beautiful Eiffel Tower in the background makes for a great romantic pose. But whats the white spot on the tip? I would have preferred the whole of tower in the pic   That would be a result of the fog light shining through the fog.', '2012-12-10 18:21:36.000000', NULL, 0),
