(6929961, 1042917, 112972, '<td valign="top">Juliet, good work, but you''ve gotta be careful with your selections as the transitions from the green areas into her skirt look to have been done in a pretty abrupt way ... the edges are too hard and sharp.  Perhaps fading your selection a bit will help.  Nice model and pose ... and good post processing on her face.</td>', 'Juliet, good work, but you''ve gotta be careful with your selections as the transitions from the green areas into her skirt look to have been done in a pretty abrupt way ... the edges are too hard and sharp.  Perhaps fading your selection a bit will help.  Nice model and pose ... and good post processing on her face.', '2012-12-11 12:41:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6930007, 1043227, 79586, '<td valign="top">:-(<br/>I''m so sorry... I dont have recived the proof request e-mail, only the disqualified e-mail...<br/>I can''t upload, the original file in time.<br/> <br/>Thank you for voting!!!!! <br/> <br/>Next time, I will return! ;-)</td>', ':-(I''m so sorry... I dont have recived the proof request e-mail, only the disqualified e-mail...I can''t upload, the original file in time. Thank you for voting!!!!!  Next time, I will return! ;-)', '2012-12-11 13:59:40.000000', NULL, 0),
