(6930152, 1042917, 97225, '<td valign="top">Wow, Juliet! Congratulations. This is really cool and out of the box. My first thought was the figurehead of a ship but then her skirt becomes a landscape. Just fantastic.</td>', 'Wow, Juliet! Congratulations. This is really cool and out of the box. My first thought was the figurehead of a ship but then her skirt becomes a landscape. Just fantastic.', '2012-12-11 18:51:22.000000', NULL, 0),
