(6930792, 1042980, 109387, '<td valign="top">And this Italian title? Do you know my language apart from knowing our cookery? ;)<br/> <br/>Nice food pic... in FS it seems that only landscapes can get a sweet score...</td>', 'And this Italian title? Do you know my language apart from knowing our cookery? ;) Nice food pic... in FS it seems that only landscapes can get a sweet score...', '2012-12-12 09:37:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6930806, 1043267, 114233, '<td valign="top">Sorry I''m only getting to commenting on this now. I have wanted to write for a few days already. As <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=113591" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">herfotoman</a> said - bloody marvelous! Hunter and hunted in focus on a shallow DOF plane is never easy let alone for a BIF shot. Its hard enough with any wildlife but I can appreciate the technical difficulties here - well done on a super image!<br/>I also like the slight blur in the wings to show the speed at which the action is happening at. Freezing the scene totally wouldnt have the same effect of speed even if you couldnt increase the shutter speed due to ISO / Aperture limitations - I think you did very well!</td>', 'Sorry I''m only getting to commenting on this now. I have wanted to write for a few days already. As  herfotoman said - bloody marvelous! Hunter and hunted in focus on a shallow DOF plane is never easy let alone for a BIF shot. Its hard enough with any wildlife but I can appreciate the technical difficulties here - well done on a super image!I also like the slight blur in the wings to show the speed at which the action is happening at. Freezing the scene totally wouldnt have the same effect of speed even if you couldnt increase the shutter speed due to ISO / Aperture limitations - I think you did very well!', '2012-12-12 09:57:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6930895, 1043393, 23098, '<td valign="top">My first look at the FS.  Glad I didn''t miss this well shot portrait.  Love it.</td>', 'My first look at the FS.  Glad I didn''t miss this well shot portrait.  Love it.', '2012-12-12 12:34:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(6930910, 1041485, 77009, '<td valign="top">This is the best photo in this free study. Not as clean or well executed technically but still very good and it tells a fantastic story. The composition is fantastic.</td>', 'This is the best photo in this free study. Not as clean or well executed technically but still very good and it tells a fantastic story. The composition is fantastic.', '2012-12-12 12:56:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6931018, 1042150, 62318, '<td valign="top">The shapes, they are great here; and the leading line helps keep the photo balanced.</td>', 'The shapes, they are great here; and the leading line helps keep the photo balanced.', '2012-12-12 15:05:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6931158, 1041155, 12611, '<td valign="top">Nice job Mark, tones are super. Good story, too.</td>', 'Nice job Mark, tones are super. Good story, too.', '2012-12-12 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6931451, 1042881, 119419, '<td valign="top">It''s that funny lens again, it''s making you even better, such dynamics in proportionality.</td>', 'It''s that funny lens again, it''s making you even better, such dynamics in proportionality.', '2012-12-13 09:27:48.000000', NULL, 0);
